==Battleground==
*3 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Festival Sign Girl]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
